BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Transfer planning: a flight to Mars</h1>
A delta-glider in a 300 km Earth orbit in March 2001. The script plans the
transfer to a 500 km Mars orbit in the 2001 window, arms its nodes and flies
them with the burn autopilot: the ejection, targeted again two orbits before
it, corrections computed shortly before they are due, the capture; then it
checks the Mars orbit.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51982.6685767396
  Script Tests/TransferMarsFlightTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship GL-M
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET GL-M
  MODE Extern
  POS 4 0 -20
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
GL-M:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Orbiting Earth
  ELEMENTS 6671000.0 0.00000 28.5 0.0 0.0 0.0 51982.6685767396
  AROT 0 0 0
  PRPLEVEL 0:1.000 1:1.000
END
END_SHIPS
